[引用原文已无法访问]","imgs":[]},{"post":"1ykCpo8Iers","floor":"26918847","text":"他的故事都在他的发言里面，一言难尽，有空可以去看看[引用原文已无法访问]","imgs":[]},{"post":"1ykCorQYZtG","floor":"26865831","text":"感觉在做梦[引用原文已无法访问]","imgs":[]},{"post":"1ykCol1ttpe","floor":"26858530","text":"既然大家都这么说，那就走咯，只许爆拉不许暴跌~~~[淘股吧]","imgs":["https://image.tgb.cn/img/2017/08/29/hzxs8y90goo2.png_max.png"]},{"post":"1ykCkZNrIV2","floor":"26837758","text":"叔你好，整篇帖子我都看完了，非常佩服阿姨的手艺，我也是每天自己做饭，看看我的几个拿手菜，指点一下，哈哈。","imgs":["https://image.tgb.cn/img/2017/08/27/sh93hf5tpo0o.jpg_max.png","https://image.tgb.cn/img/2017/08/27/wlhsml8fh0or.jpg_max.png","https://image.tgb.cn/img/2017/08/27/a2tr8b9q5ko0.jpg_max.png","https://image.tgb.cn/img/2017/08/27/jt0vla0iqp0o.jpg_max.png","https://image.tgb.cn/img/2017/08/27/6q8xw2r44vu0.jpg_max.png","https://image.tgb.cn/img/2017/08/27/846kghfc8f70.jpg_max.png","https://image.tgb.cn/img/2017/08/27/376itua2l0or.jpg_max.png","https://image.tgb.cn/img/2017/08/27/wzbrnkbbfok0.jpg_max.png","https://image.tgb.cn/img/2017/08/27/aa9yc436t0or.jpg_max.png"]},{"post":"1ykCiy1rwWr","floor":"26547264","text":"666[引用原文已无法访问]","imgs":[]},{"post":"1ykCgXIgVPN","floor":"26458878","text":"","imgs":["https://image.tgb.cn/img/2017/07/25/2koqsn22s4jq.jpeg_max.png"]},{"post":"1ykBLi7NRum","floor":"25047175","text":"昨天晚上挂的单没撤，如果一个股需要你来回撤才能找到好的买点那么就不要去买，因为你第二天肯定开盘就砸了，何必为了这点蝇头小利操心这么多呢。","imgs":["https://image.tgb.cn/img/2017/03/30/27l12sqzue6x.png_max.png"]},{"post":"1ykBLi7NRum","floor":"25037950","text":"","imgs":["https://image.tgb.cn/img/2017/03/29/rb06q8hgfbvw.png_max.png"]},{"post":"1ykBLi7NRum","floor":"25025876","text":"","imgs":["https://image.tgb.cn/img/2017/03/28/kgokm0vdknzv.png_max.png"]},{"post":"1ykBLi7NRum","floor":"25014082","text":"被吹票的帖子冲昏了头脑，开盘冲高没出是个错误","imgs":["https://image.tgb.cn/img/2017/03/27/31jwj2m04u2o.png_max.png"]},{"post":"1ykBLi7NRum","floor":"24987783","text":"","imgs":["https://image.tgb.cn/img/2017/03/24/7ofsp7p3vbr2.png_max.png"]},{"post":"1ykBLi7NRum","floor":"24977035","text":"","imgs":["https://image.tgb.cn/img/2017/03/23/lux7xchk91uq.png_max.png"]},{"post":"1ykBLi7NRum","floor":"24962835","text":"空仓","imgs":["https://image.tgb.cn/img/2017/03/22/7eg8rms1fp1o.png_max.png"]},{"post":"1ykBLi7NRum","floor":"24953101","text":"继续，勇敢面对，我一定能行！[淘股吧]","imgs":["https://image.tgb.cn/img/2017/03/21/n39escpt9o1o.png_max.png"]},{"post":"1ykBLi7NRum","floor":"24937386","text":"今天开盘还是龙头，然后直接被砸残了，午盘抢过龙头，不到10分钟又被天山的资金抢先封了。","imgs":["https://image.tgb.cn/img/2017/03/20/4g9mnn5hnyn1.png_max.png"]},{"post":"1ykBLi7NRum","floor":"24912247","text":"踩雷了，买到个长线庄运作的股票，今天最好的操作就是空仓。","imgs":["https://image.tgb.cn/img/2017/03/17/nafae85t6sk1.png_max.png"]},{"post":"1ykBLi7NRum","floor":"24898072","text":"不要大意，保持谨慎，随时准备空仓。","imgs":["https://image.tgb.cn/img/2017/03/16/0kbl6ygqd0lj.png_max.png"]},{"post":"1ykBLi7NRum","floor":"24882668","text":"白银有色开盘卖了，这种牛股我是很难拿住的，感觉今天会收个烂板， 后面的钱不是我的能力范围之内了。另外注意，大赚之后自信心会大增，此时需要随时保持警醒，否则容易乱买导致回撤。","imgs":["https://image.tgb.cn/img/2017/03/15/73clnfv9si0o.png_max.png"]},{"post":"1ykBLi7NRum","floor":"24874016","text":"","imgs":["https://image.tgb.cn/img/2017/03/14/anoe4oi476h0.png_max.png"]},{"post":"1ykBLi7NRum","floor":"24861888","text":"这种主要是赚今天的钱，低吸空间不够就放弃。","imgs":["https://image.tgb.cn/img/2017/03/13/0evx7p6z2g0o.png_max.png"]},{"post":"1ykBLi7NRum","floor":"24841110","text":"今天还是空仓，早上排了会云意电气，快到我的时候撤单了，没想到后面的跟着撤了5W手，不想买的原因主要是心里没底，虽然封单一直很大但感觉是大资金加上去的，如果要走趋势线行情那打板也不会有太多的肉。","imgs":["https://image.tgb.cn/img/2017/03/10/zaugtu76qcd0.png_max.png"]},{"post":"1ykBLi7NRum","floor":"24838086","text":"[淘股吧]昨天空仓，忘记上图了","imgs":["https://image.tgb.cn/img/2017/03/09/bn3a5ykzz8gc.png_max.png"]},{"post":"1ykBLi7NRum","floor":"24815600","text":"今天要是还做不到空仓的话，那我的的确确就是一个废人了。","imgs":["https://image.tgb.cn/img/2017/03/08/j0d6tqshmpbz.png_max.png"]},{"post":"1ykBLi7NRum","floor":"24805512","text":"以后尽量规避庄股，如果碰到了就及时卖出。 [淘股吧]今天上午看了一下次新股超预期，诺邦股份昨天放大量今天没开板，德创环保下午没回封没道理，从盘面来看市场关注度是很高的，但就是缺少大资金的参与，从今天次","imgs":["https://image.tgb.cn/img/2017/03/07/bh8ycdusrgaz.png_max.png"]},{"post":"1ykBLi7NRum","floor":"24793243","text":"今天只是运气，明天不要过多意淫，随时准备卖出。","imgs":["https://image.tgb.cn/img/2017/03/06/101owz65c9zn.png_max.png"]},{"post":"1ykBGTOOa5F","floor":"24659539","text":"早上看错了，以为二封了就买了，犯这种错误主要还是复盘没做好，以及太急了","imgs":["https://image.tgb.cn/img/2017/02/20/dczvvd0yjivt.png_max.png"]},{"post":"1ykBGTOOa5F","floor":"24542862","text":"搞了三江","imgs":["https://image.tgb.cn/img/2017/02/07/pcydefxvg2ag.png_max.png"]},{"post":"1ykBGTOOa5F","floor":"24540582","text":"今天跌停割完同力水泥后，我打算空仓计划明天买次新股的，下午看到新亚制程拉升3个点的时候，小明跟我说，新亚制程也是庄股，参考1月20的利君股份今天肯定拉到涨停，我也是傻，二话没说就买了。","imgs":["https://image.tgb.cn/img/2017/02/06/ub2incqeffvn.png_max.png"]},{"post":"1ykBd54MMzv","floor":"23017978","text":"","imgs":["https://image.tgb.cn/img/2016/08/20/w29ipo87zo6j.png_max.png"]},{"post":"1ykBbxxUItd","floor":"22925111","text":"@古天乐[淘股吧]","imgs":["https://image.tgb.cn/img/2016/08/10/0gp19nv78ele.png_max.png"]},{"post":"1ykBbxxUItd","floor":"22924948","text":"[淘股吧] 我先挂跌停了啊，嘿嘿，比比谁的通道快","imgs":["https://image.tgb.cn/img/2016/08/10/0gp19nv78ele.png_max.png"]},{"post":"1ykAZVq8W7j","floor":"22387197","text":"77/15066/100 [淘股吧]","imgs":["https://image.tgb.cn/img/2016/06/14/pbrimh321uxi.png_max.png"]},{"post":"1ykAZVq8W7j","floor":"22375584","text":"","imgs":["https://image.tgb.cn/img/2016/06/13/j1zrd4cgptxi.png_max.png"]},{"post":"1ykAZVq8W7j","floor":"22350606","text":"[淘股吧]这周一共就三天，空仓了一天锁仓了一天，交割单也很干净。。","imgs":["https://image.tgb.cn/img/2016/06/09/hns3lqcdgbwp.png_max.png"]},{"post":"1ykAZVq8W7j","floor":"22342094","text":"77/15981/100/-300","imgs":["https://image.tgb.cn/img/2016/06/08/grqxu7zuq29o.jpg_max.png"]},{"post":"1ykAZVq8W7j","floor":"22331057","text":"77/14828/100/-600[淘股吧]取了600 ， 度假","imgs":["https://image.tgb.cn/img/2016/06/07/jam4jt4lrsnw.png_max.png"]},{"post":"1ykAZVq8W7j","floor":"22321850","text":"77/15433/0/-400 [淘股吧]取了400，这格式对吧","imgs":["https://image.tgb.cn/img/2016/06/06/8rx4fngu42mw.png_max.png"]},{"post":"1ykAZVq8W7j","floor":"22298390","text":"77/15452/